#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:272
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Doklady"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:273
msgid ""
"Card and gateway payments get an invoice right away, cash on delivery when "
"the order is completed, refunds a credit note. A document whose total in "
"Denár differs from the order stays a draft for you to check."
msgstr ""
"Platba kartou alebo bránou dostane faktúru hneď, dobierka pri vybavení "
"objednávky, vrátenie peňazí dobropis. Doklad, ktorého suma v Denári nesedí s"
" objednávkou, ostane konceptom na kontrolu."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:277
msgid "Send orders to Denár"
msgstr "Odosielať objednávky do Denára"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:278
msgid "Issue documents for orders automatically"
msgstr "Automaticky vystavovať doklady k objednávkam"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:284
msgid "Bank transfer"
msgstr "Bankový prevod"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:285
msgid ""
"Issue a proforma with PAY by square when the order is placed; the invoice "
"follows once Denár pairs the payment"
msgstr ""
"Pri objednávke vystaviť zálohovú faktúru s PAY by square; faktúra nasleduje,"
" keď Denár spáruje úhradu"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:291
msgid "Number series"
msgstr "Číselný rad"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:294
msgid "default"
msgstr "predvolený"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:295
msgid ""
"Code of a number series from Denár -> Settings -> Number series. Empty = the"
" series set on the API key, or the default one."
msgstr ""
"Kód číselného radu z Denár -> Nastavenia -> Číselné rady. Prázdne = rad "
"nastavený pri API kľúči, inak predvolený."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:299
msgid "EU reverse charge"
msgstr "Prenesenie daňovej povinnosti v EÚ"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:303
msgid "Goods to another EU member state"
msgstr "Tovar do iného členského štátu EÚ"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:304
